1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 19=

10
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:50,710
Xiao Yunting,

11
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,670
which one

12
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,110
is the real you?

13
00:00:58,710 --> 00:00:59,520
I didn't know

14
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,520
what I had done before.

15
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:04,230
But this time,

16
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:05,840
my love for you is true.

17
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:07,980
My affection for you is true as well.

18
00:01:08,790 --> 00:01:10,000
No matter what happens,

19
00:01:11,230 --> 00:01:13,000
I'll stay by your side forever.

20
00:01:18,610 --> 00:01:23,190
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

21
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:27,440
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

22
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:33,400
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

23
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:37,790
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

24
00:01:38,650 --> 00:01:42,860
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

25
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:50,400
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪

26
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:51,310
Young Lady Qi,

27
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,150
this is bad!

28
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,590
Someone from the
Xiang Residence just came.

29
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:55,230
They said Miss Xiang has gone missing.

30
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,150
What?

31
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,710
I promise I'll cure your leg.

32
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:02,870
No!

33
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:04,430
I have to save Xiang Rong!

34
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,030
Hand over Xiang Rong.

35
00:02:08,150 --> 00:02:09,400
Someone saw

36
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,080
you and her meet at the lantern festival.

37
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,800
I honestly have no idea where she is.

38
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:13,750
Stop pretending.

39
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,580
You sneaked back to
the capital on your own

40
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:16,800
and thought we would not know?

41
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,240
I really didn't...

42
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,080
Yuan.

43
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:20,030
Xiang Rong.

44
00:02:22,590 --> 00:02:23,190
Come on.

45
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,190
Move!

46
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,400
Are you hurt?

47
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:35,960
Did he do anything to you?

48
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,150
I'm fine.

49
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:39,590
Qi Zhao saved me.

50
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,360
Someone tried to abduct me
at the lantern festival just now.

51
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:43,750
Luckily, he arrived in time.

52
00:02:44,150 --> 00:02:45,710
He took a blade for me.

53
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:46,560
Him?

54
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,680
Saved you?

55
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,240
Did you hear that?

56
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:57,590
I risked my life to protect Miss Xiang.

57
00:02:58,710 --> 00:02:59,560
And you?

58
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:02,430
You tried to kill your own brother.

59
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:11,000
It's true that I went after you before.

60
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:13,120
You don't trust me now.

61
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:14,750
I understand that.

62
00:03:16,310 --> 00:03:18,280
But I really have changed.

63
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:19,590
Look at me.

64
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:21,360
I've been studying in this manor.

65
00:03:22,150 --> 00:03:24,120
I miss Grandfather
and Grandmother terribly.

66
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,240
So,

67
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:27,590
I wanted to come back and visit them.

68
00:03:30,260 --> 00:03:31,420
(Studying Guanzi's Discourses on Salt.
Salt and iron are the lifeblood of the state)

69
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,000
This is well written.

70
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,870
I can tell you studied hard.

71
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,190
Very good.

72
00:03:50,470 --> 00:03:51,310
You believe him?

73
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,150
I checked his wound.

74
00:03:53,470 --> 00:03:56,150
If that blade had been
just half an inch off,

75
00:03:56,250 --> 00:03:57,360
he would have died for sure.

76
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,910
Since he risked his life
to save Xiang Rong,

77
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:01,430
I'll take

78
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:02,870
that debt.

79
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:11,910
This matter

80
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,870
will proceed as we just discussed.

81
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:14,750
Good.

82
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:15,960
Then

83
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:18,160
I'll go get ready.

84
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:21,720
Father.

85
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:26,160
Zhao is the only son
of the Marquis Residence.

86
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:27,630
I understand

87
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,510
that you want to bring him back.

88
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,630
But his return

89
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:33,040
is too suspicious.

90
00:04:33,310 --> 00:04:34,920
So the matter of Consort Great Liu

91
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:37,000
should not be known to him.

92
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:37,920
No worries.

93
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,480
I understand.

94
00:04:46,580 --> 00:04:49,180
(Aboveboard, Main Hall)

95
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,240
Greetings, Your Highness.

96
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,680
You are Yunting?

97
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:55,680
(Consort Great Liu,
the Emperor's former love)

98
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,600
Your eyes and brows

99
00:04:56,920 --> 00:05:00,310
do resemble your grandfather's.

100
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,720
Eldest Princess, please.

101
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:11,000
Sister-in-law.

102
00:05:15,070 --> 00:05:17,720
I thought I would never see you again.

103
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:23,560
Back then, Consort Little Liu
drove me out of the palace.

104
00:05:24,580 --> 00:05:26,240
I was gravely injured
and never recovered.

105
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,360
I had no one to turn to.

106
00:05:28,950 --> 00:05:30,240
I wanted nothing more to do

107
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,800
with the palace.

108
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:37,360
I had planned to live in seclusion
for the rest of my days.

109
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,390
I never expected

110
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,310
the Marquis to find me.

111
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,000
Only then did I learn

112
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,680
about the matters of the Prince Consort
and the Commandery Princess.

113
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,480
You have suffered.

114
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,430
Sister-in-law,

115
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,600
I've dragged you back

116
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,430
into this old case.

117
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:56,070
I...

118
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,160
I...

119
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,000
His Majesty is away on a royal hunt.

120
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,390
He returns to the capital tomorrow.

121
00:06:02,430 --> 00:06:03,950
I have told His Majesty

122
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,300
that Your Highness has returned.

123
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,800
Tomorrow, Your Highness will be reunited

124
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,830
with His Majesty.

125
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,510
Tomorrow.

126
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,560
I will surely seek justice.

127
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:23,950
On the road back to the capital,

128
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,000
we did not see any of Prince Qi's men.

129
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:28,240
They didn't set an ambush along the way.

130
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,800
So they will strike in the capital.

131
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,120
I have sent more men.

132
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:33,480
Guanyin Temple is now like an iron fortress.

133
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:35,160
He won't have a chance to act.

134
00:06:35,170 --> 00:06:36,350
Your Highness, rest assured.

135
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,990
Your meals and daily life will be
looked after by the Marquis Residence.

136
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,360
There will be no mistake.

137
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,870
Why didn't you read it?

138
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:56,830
I just feel that

139
00:06:57,680 --> 00:07:00,160
meeting you was the greatest blessing.

140
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,040
Why should I ask the gods

141
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,680
about anything else?

142
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,560
You little copycat.

143
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,310
Consort Great Liu is resting.

144
00:07:11,310 --> 00:07:12,630
Father is guarding outside.

145
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:13,790
Why don't you go back

146
00:07:13,830 --> 00:07:15,240
and rest early too?

147
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,560
Draw a lot.

148
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,560
Give it a try.

149
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,430
It's very accurate.

150
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:37,920
What did it say?

151
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:38,920
Nothing.

152
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:40,680
Let me see.

153
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,600
Nothing.

154
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,390
Let me see.

155
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:42,920
Give it here.

156
00:07:42,950 --> 00:07:43,520
Give it to me.

157
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,950
A broken mirror can be mended,
though scars remain.

158
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,870
A bare branch meets spring
and protects its roots.

159
00:07:54,260 --> 00:07:56,690
Through wind and rain,
you're bound by a debt from a past life.

160
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:59,430
The person in your heart
has never once left.

161
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,000
That's pretty accurate.

162
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,560
Pretty accurate?

163
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:10,660
(Excellent fortune)

164
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,360
You tricked me.

165
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,310
Look, it says...

166
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:15,800
Uh.

167
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,920
How is that tricking you?

168
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,680
You are.

169
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,120
I just wanted to show you

170
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,240
our future..

171
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,750
After tomorrow,

172
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,000
when the dust settles,

173
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,800
the great affairs of this world

174
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,240
will no longer concern us.

175
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,150
From then on,

176
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,480
it'll be just the two of us.

177
00:08:48,882 --> 00:08:51,242
There is no lying before the Buddha.

178
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,740
(Bad fortune, Excellent fortune)

179
00:09:09,110 --> 00:09:13,750
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

180
00:09:14,130 --> 00:09:17,910
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

181
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:23,880
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

182
00:09:24,100 --> 00:09:28,260
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

183
00:09:29,050 --> 00:09:33,330
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

184
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:41,030
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
